    "Content": "Azure AI Speech makes the LLM Speech API generally available, delivering state-of-the-art LLM-powered transcription and translation for audio files, with multi-lingual support across 25 languages (90+ locales), improved accuracy, expanded regions, and enhanced prompt-tuning capabilities.&nbsp;<br><br><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2Fllm-speech&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cazureupdatesops%40microsoft.com%7C4a4dedb90de24f8decdd08debcdde7cf%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639155858432252377%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=g9A4rfskgoQK%2Fad9WUhdrLjcCnlSr74FCVDgGQBoIUw%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://aka.ms/llm-speech. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a>.<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/speech-service/llm-speech\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a>",
    "Markdown": "Azure AI Speech makes the LLM Speech API generally available, delivering state-of-the-art LLM-powered transcription and translation for audio files, with multi-lingual support across 25 languages (90+ locales), improved accuracy, expanded regions, and enhanced prompt-tuning capabilities.\n\nLearn more ."
